1
00:00:08,636 --> 00:00:14,448
♪Myriad delusions cut like knives♪

2
00:00:14,448 --> 00:00:20,416
♪Crushing the moon in the ancient well♪

3
00:00:20,598 --> 00:00:25,536
♪Lost in this life,
I never ask about tomorrow♪

4
00:00:25,536 --> 00:00:31,216
♪When love runs deep,
the moonlight fades♪

5
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:39,851
♪A cursed fate,
a dream severed over lifetimes♪

6
00:00:40,662 --> 00:00:44,310
=Braving the Famine with My Wife=

7
00:00:44,599 --> 00:00:46,778
=Episode 18=

8
00:00:47,420 --> 00:00:49,939
- Welcome, True Immortal.
- Welcome, True Immortal.

9
00:00:56,859 --> 00:00:59,579
Before a True Immortal,
why don't you kneel?

10
00:01:01,880 --> 00:01:02,880
Kneel.

11
00:01:03,100 --> 00:01:04,100
Kneel.

12
00:01:05,400 --> 00:01:06,700
Because you're not worthy.

13
00:01:07,939 --> 00:01:10,760
In this world, only one man
is worthy of my kneeling.

14
00:01:12,280 --> 00:01:13,280
Kneel!

15
00:01:30,239 --> 00:01:31,780
I wonder if Dong

16
00:01:32,019 --> 00:01:33,439
can bring Yunxi back this time.

17
00:01:33,859 --> 00:01:36,420
Don't worry, Hanyan.

18
00:01:36,599 --> 00:01:37,859
Dong's power

19
00:01:37,939 --> 00:01:39,379
shakes the heavens.

20
00:01:39,859 --> 00:01:42,519
Nothing can ever stop him.

21
00:01:43,680 --> 00:01:44,980
Besides, he said

22
00:01:45,299 --> 00:01:46,959
my father's time in prison will be over.

23
00:01:47,400 --> 00:01:48,640
His trip to the capital

24
00:01:48,840 --> 00:01:50,760
will not only clear my father's name

25
00:01:51,140 --> 00:01:53,180
but also earn him a promotion.

26
00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:57,140
Then congratulations, Hanyan.

27
00:01:57,140 --> 00:01:59,579
You'll soon be a noble lady again.

28
00:02:00,680 --> 00:02:03,159
Stop teasing me, Wan'er.

29
00:02:03,280 --> 00:02:05,500
I have only one role that matters,

30
00:02:05,939 --> 00:02:07,140
which is Dong's wife

31
00:02:07,420 --> 00:02:09,199
and your sister.

32
00:02:09,919 --> 00:02:10,919
That's more like it.

33
00:02:11,039 --> 00:02:13,240
Dong and I didn't dote on you
for nothing.

34
00:02:14,840 --> 00:02:17,000
Master Zhao? Is Master Zhao here?

35
00:02:17,300 --> 00:02:18,300
You are?

36
00:02:18,300 --> 00:02:21,060
I'm here to beg Master Zhao
to treat our magistrate.

37
00:02:21,060 --> 00:02:22,259
Our lord is dying.

38
00:02:22,259 --> 00:02:23,699
No physician in the city can help.

39
00:02:23,699 --> 00:02:25,639
So our only hope now is Master Zhao.

40
00:02:26,900 --> 00:02:27,900
Wan'er,

41
00:02:27,900 --> 00:02:30,199
didn't Dong leave
a secret pouch before he left?

42
00:02:30,659 --> 00:02:32,599
He said it could save a life
in an emergency.

43
00:02:34,520 --> 00:02:35,520
I remember now.

44
00:02:49,180 --> 00:02:51,960
Revitalizing Pill,
a gift for the magistrate.

45
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:54,939
How did Dong know?

46
00:02:59,099 --> 00:03:00,259
Master Zhao is miraculous.

47
00:03:00,439 --> 00:03:02,180
Our lord is saved.

48
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:12,840
Her Majesty and that commoner

49
00:03:12,840 --> 00:03:14,919
have been in the chambers
for three days.

50
00:03:15,199 --> 00:03:17,300
That man is truly incredible.

51
00:03:17,560 --> 00:03:18,560
Tell me about it.

52
00:03:18,719 --> 00:03:19,840
The sound was like thunder.

53
00:03:20,080 --> 00:03:22,060
I bet the entire inner palace heard it.

54
00:03:22,159 --> 00:03:25,560
But who do you think that man really is?

55
00:03:26,460 --> 00:03:27,599
No matter who he is,

56
00:03:27,740 --> 00:03:29,580
he'll stand at the very top from now on.

57
00:03:37,099 --> 00:03:38,400
Can't you show some respect?

58
00:03:38,960 --> 00:03:40,439
This is the Imperial Seal.

59
00:03:40,580 --> 00:03:42,439
It represents supreme authority
over the realm.

60
00:03:43,699 --> 00:03:44,860
In my eyes,

61
00:03:45,360 --> 00:03:46,840
it's just a rock.

62
00:03:48,759 --> 00:03:50,280
It can't compare to you at all.

63
00:04:02,460 --> 00:04:03,460
You...

64
00:04:03,840 --> 00:04:05,240
I always stamp decrees with it.

65
00:04:05,680 --> 00:04:07,039
How dare you stamp me with it?

66
00:04:07,699 --> 00:04:09,319
You have a death wish.

67
00:04:17,759 --> 00:04:18,759
Zhao Dong,

68
00:04:20,139 --> 00:04:21,339
can you stay for me?

69
00:04:23,360 --> 00:04:25,019
When we were intimate,

70
00:04:25,180 --> 00:04:27,079
you kept calling me my first name.

71
00:04:27,800 --> 00:04:30,019
And now that our clothes are back on,

72
00:04:30,819 --> 00:04:32,000
you call me by my full name?

73
00:04:33,420 --> 00:04:35,060
Answer my question.

74
00:04:40,420 --> 00:04:42,639
Yunxi, my heart lies elsewhere.

75
00:04:43,660 --> 00:04:46,660
The vast mortal realm
is my true place of cultivation.

76
00:04:48,040 --> 00:04:50,160
Why don't you come with me?

77
00:04:50,639 --> 00:04:51,759
We can travel the realm,

78
00:04:51,920 --> 00:04:52,920
free and untamed.

79
00:04:53,540 --> 00:04:54,540
Wouldn't it be wonderful?

80
00:04:57,579 --> 00:04:58,699
Thank you, Zhao Dong.

81
00:04:59,500 --> 00:05:02,600
Thank you for saving me
time and time again

82
00:05:03,699 --> 00:05:06,279
and for respecting my choice.

83
00:05:07,939 --> 00:05:10,540
But I can't go with you.

84
00:05:12,600 --> 00:05:14,620
The court is still unstable.

85
00:05:15,019 --> 00:05:16,019
The realm is in turmoil.

86
00:05:16,439 --> 00:05:18,439
Since Heaven chose me,
Chu Yunxi, as the ruler.

87
00:05:18,980 --> 00:05:20,040
I must stay

88
00:05:20,500 --> 00:05:21,800
and fulfill my duty.

89
00:05:23,879 --> 00:05:26,600
All right. I support you.

90
00:05:27,720 --> 00:05:30,819
But there's something
I need your help with.

91
00:05:31,920 --> 00:05:33,079
Hanyan's father,

92
00:05:33,519 --> 00:05:35,579
Liu Wenyuan, Huainan Judicial Director,

93
00:05:36,319 --> 00:05:37,339
offended the chancellor

94
00:05:37,660 --> 00:05:38,660
and was imprisoned.

95
00:05:40,680 --> 00:05:41,680
Rest assured.

96
00:05:41,680 --> 00:05:44,779
I myself will see his name cleared.

97
00:05:46,819 --> 00:05:47,819
That's not enough.

98
00:05:48,139 --> 00:05:50,600
I want you to grant him
a major promotion,

99
00:05:50,759 --> 00:05:52,199
at least of the second rank.

100
00:05:52,879 --> 00:05:55,399
Otherwise, I can't face my family
when I return.

101
00:05:56,920 --> 00:05:58,300
Don't push your luck.

102
00:05:58,579 --> 00:05:59,899
Do you think a second-rank title

103
00:05:59,899 --> 00:06:01,660
is something you can help yourself to?

104
00:06:03,620 --> 00:06:06,459
He's only a sixth-rank
Judicial Director.

105
00:06:06,779 --> 00:06:08,199
How would the court accept

106
00:06:08,339 --> 00:06:09,339
such a sudden leap?

107
00:06:12,040 --> 00:06:13,040
What's wrong?

108
00:06:13,519 --> 00:06:17,160
Can't you pull some strings for me?

109
00:06:17,459 --> 00:06:20,060
You... Be serious.

110
00:06:21,860 --> 00:06:27,800
But I can make him
a fourth-rank Grand Master.

111
00:06:28,199 --> 00:06:30,500
As for the rest,
we'll take one step at a time.

112
00:06:32,060 --> 00:06:34,420
Fair enough, we'll do it your way.

113
00:06:34,819 --> 00:06:36,959
As long as it doesn't embarrass me.

114
00:06:37,839 --> 00:06:39,259
I am the Empress.

115
00:06:39,759 --> 00:06:42,800
Everything is under my control.

116
00:06:44,959 --> 00:06:45,959
Your Majesty,

117
00:06:46,319 --> 00:06:49,360
aren't you under my control right now?

118
00:06:49,360 --> 00:06:50,360
You...

119
00:06:51,319 --> 00:06:53,319
All right, no more teasing.

120
00:06:55,000 --> 00:06:56,000
Yunxi,

121
00:06:57,139 --> 00:06:59,360
we'll meet again soon.

122
00:07:12,876 --> 00:07:17,564
(Affection)

123
00:07:22,019 --> 00:07:25,160
Attendants, prepare me for court.

124
00:07:27,259 --> 00:07:30,819
My son, wake up.

125
00:07:36,199 --> 00:07:37,360
My son,

126
00:07:38,939 --> 00:07:40,699
wake up.

127
00:07:41,220 --> 00:07:43,220
Madam! Madam!

128
00:07:43,279 --> 00:07:45,160
I brought back
Master Zhao's Revitalizing Pill.

129
00:07:49,360 --> 00:07:50,899
It's too late.

130
00:07:52,660 --> 00:07:55,480
My son is already gone.

131
00:07:56,439 --> 00:07:57,439
What?

132
00:07:58,579 --> 00:08:02,660
Young Master, how could you leave us?

133
00:08:03,360 --> 00:08:04,860
Passing away so young...

134
00:08:05,699 --> 00:08:07,339
What a tragedy.

135
00:08:08,060 --> 00:08:10,459
Madam, since we have the pill,

136
00:08:10,560 --> 00:08:11,639
why not give it a try?

137
00:08:11,639 --> 00:08:13,199
What if there's still a chance?

138
00:08:13,779 --> 00:08:15,399
For what?

139
00:08:16,620 --> 00:08:18,180
My son has passed away.

140
00:08:18,920 --> 00:08:22,579
Do you want to disturb his peace
even in death?

141
00:08:23,420 --> 00:08:24,420
Get out.

142
00:08:25,839 --> 00:08:27,220
All of you, get out.

143
00:08:27,319 --> 00:08:28,319
Madam,

144
00:08:28,319 --> 00:08:29,319
please calm down.

145
00:08:29,420 --> 00:08:31,439
My husband has divine foresight

146
00:08:31,439 --> 00:08:32,440
and boundless power.

147
00:08:32,639 --> 00:08:35,259
Since he left a secret pouch
for the magistrate,

148
00:08:35,259 --> 00:08:37,039
there must be hope.

149
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:39,240
Enough!

150
00:08:40,360 --> 00:08:42,200
My son's body is barely cold.

151
00:08:42,419 --> 00:08:44,460
How dare you spout nonsense here?

152
00:08:45,059 --> 00:08:46,320
Feeding my dead son a pill

153
00:08:46,919 --> 00:08:49,039
is a desecration to him,

154
00:08:49,080 --> 00:08:50,100
an insult!

155
00:08:50,139 --> 00:08:52,139
Guards, see them out!

156
00:08:52,399 --> 00:08:53,399
But...

157
00:08:56,440 --> 00:08:58,840
You wretch! How dare you defile my son!

158
00:08:58,840 --> 00:08:59,840
Wan'er!

159
00:09:01,200 --> 00:09:02,200
You...

160
00:09:02,200 --> 00:09:04,399
Madam, you may strike me,

161
00:09:04,700 --> 00:09:07,159
but I truly want Lord Liang to live.

162
00:09:07,379 --> 00:09:09,159
Don't try to deceive me.

163
00:09:09,679 --> 00:09:11,379
The dead cannot return to life.

164
00:09:11,700 --> 00:09:14,039
You're all up to no good,

165
00:09:14,039 --> 00:09:15,240
trying to humiliate my son!

166
00:09:15,399 --> 00:09:16,399
Liang Shanbo!

167
00:09:16,539 --> 00:09:17,840
If you're still a man

168
00:09:17,840 --> 00:09:19,360
and care about the people,

169
00:09:19,360 --> 00:09:20,779
then wake up now!

170
00:09:21,039 --> 00:09:24,100
How can you leave your mother
and all the refugees?

171
00:09:25,120 --> 00:09:26,879
Get out, all of you!

172
00:09:27,279 --> 00:09:29,299
Let me go! Let go!

173
00:09:31,919 --> 00:09:35,799
T-T-The Young Master is alive!

174
00:09:53,563 --> 00:09:57,154
♪With a clap of thunder,
you were cast into the mortal realm♪

175
00:09:57,154 --> 00:09:59,941
♪Silk robes replaced by rags♪

176
00:10:00,517 --> 00:10:02,679
♪Immortal bones buried in the dust♪

177
00:10:02,679 --> 00:10:05,525
♪One thought once stirred the seas♪

178
00:10:05,525 --> 00:10:08,803
♪Now, even cold porridge
is a lucky find♪

179
00:10:08,803 --> 00:10:10,437
♪She was cast out of the golden hall♪

180
00:10:10,437 --> 00:10:12,501
♪With only half a tattered decree♪

181
00:10:12,501 --> 00:10:14,037
♪Her eyes still held a blade's edge♪

182
00:10:14,037 --> 00:10:16,819
♪Saying this world
isn't worth a single moment♪

183
00:10:17,268 --> 00:10:19,173
♪You handed her a bowl of coarse tea♪

184
00:10:19,173 --> 00:10:25,204
♪Telling her to taste
life's bitter and sweet♪

185
00:10:25,786 --> 00:10:29,669
♪So the Supreme Immortal
can fall to dust♪

186
00:10:29,669 --> 00:10:32,894
♪So the Empress
can feel her heart turn cold♪

187
00:10:33,406 --> 00:10:36,005
♪You watched the sunset
in a narrow alley with her♪

188
00:10:36,005 --> 00:10:41,133
♪Hearing a child cry out in pain,
yet still laughing, so silly♪

189
00:10:41,133 --> 00:10:44,661
♪So power is no match
for a bowl of warm porridge♪

190
00:10:44,661 --> 00:10:48,369
♪So heaven can't compare
to a lamp in a broken hut♪

191
00:10:48,369 --> 00:10:50,261
♪From strangers to aching hearts♪

192
00:10:50,261 --> 00:10:52,338
♪From cold words to genuine care♪

193
00:10:52,338 --> 00:10:54,869
♪In the humblest corners
of the mortal world♪

194
00:10:54,869 --> 00:10:58,906
♪You met the most precious person♪

195
00:11:00,574 --> 00:11:02,437
♪She said commoners are just numbers♪

196
00:11:02,437 --> 00:11:04,956
♪You took her to see
the fields turned to scars♪

197
00:11:04,956 --> 00:11:06,405
♪And the old man bent by firewood♪

198
00:11:06,405 --> 00:11:08,707
♪A lifetime of bitterness
on his shoulders♪

199
00:11:08,707 --> 00:11:10,677
♪For the first time,
she set aside her crown♪

200
00:11:10,677 --> 00:11:15,087
♪And held an umbrella
for a drenched street vendor♪

201
00:11:15,087 --> 00:11:16,629
♪You can no longer ride the clouds♪

202
00:11:16,629 --> 00:11:18,539
♪But only toss and turn in the night♪

203
00:11:18,539 --> 00:11:21,813
♪Still kneeling at Heaven's Gate
in your dreams♪

204
00:11:21,813 --> 00:11:25,134
♪Only to wake up
with a flatbread she tossed at you♪

205
00:11:25,134 --> 00:11:26,869
♪Saying, forget the gods♪

206
00:11:26,869 --> 00:11:31,493
♪Just catch your breath first♪

207
00:11:31,493 --> 00:11:35,243
♪So the Supreme Immortal
can fall to dust♪

208
00:11:35,243 --> 00:11:38,621
♪So the Empress can turn for someone♪

209
00:11:38,995 --> 00:11:40,965
♪No longer asking
who stands higher or mightier♪

210
00:11:40,965 --> 00:11:46,712
♪Only asking who stands
at your heart's door now♪

211
00:11:46,712 --> 00:11:50,228
♪If Heaven wants you to pass
through the street's rising smoke first♪

212
00:11:50,228 --> 00:11:51,797
♪If the mortal world cannot hold you♪

213
00:11:51,797 --> 00:11:54,107
♪Then carve the memories
into your palm lines♪

214
00:11:54,107 --> 00:11:55,845
♪From laughter to devotion♪

215
00:11:55,845 --> 00:11:57,901
♪From falling to innocence♪

216
00:11:57,901 --> 00:11:59,749
♪If there's a next life, you'll still♪

217
00:11:59,749 --> 00:12:06,419
♪Love a mortal once more
amidst this suffering♪
